{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you want to support development, please purchase this DLC!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This DLC includes Exclusive costume for Chara, 2 Special weapons and various support items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Exclusive costume that can change Chara's appearance</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Knight Costume</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">2 Special weapons</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Magic Book of Negation</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551430/extras/1_.gif?t=1741755231\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>All existing skills cannot be used, but <strong>skills unique to this book</strong> can be used.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>MAT increases greatly, but Max MP is reduced by half.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Negation of Metabolism</u></strong><u>:\u00a0Deals weak magic damage to the enemy and stops the enemy's actions for 1 turn.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551430/extras/2_\uc2e0\uc9c4\ub300\uc0ac\uc758_\ubd80\uc815.gif?t=1741755231\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Negation of Evasion</u></strong><u>:\u00a0It makes an inevitable attack. The damage is low, but there is no cooldown.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551430/extras/3_\ud68c\ud53c\uc758_\ubd80\uc815.gif?t=1741755231\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Negation of Purification</u></strong><u>:\u00a0Deals weak magic damage to the enemy.\u00a0Poisons the enemy, dealing 4% of their Max HP damage per turn.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551430/extras/4_\uc815\ud654\uc758_\ubd80\uc815.gif?t=1741755231\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Negation of Resist</u></strong><u>:\u00a0Deals magic damage equal to the enemy's MDF in addition to your MAT.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551430/extras/5_\uc800\ud56d\uc758_\ubd80\uc815.gif?t=1741755231\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Negation of Spell</u></strong><u>:\u00a0Disables the target from using the skill for 3 turns.\u00a0There is a low chance of failure, but it consumes less MP and has a short cooldown.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551430/extras/6_\uc8fc\ubb38\uc758_\ubd80\uc815.gif?t=1741755231\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Temple Knight's Armor</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3551430/extras/7_\uc2e0\uc804\uae30\uc0ac\uc758_\uac11\uc637.gif?t=1741755231\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Temple Knight's heavy armor. It is so heavy that it cannot hold a shield. (Growth Rate 25%)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Hit, Evasion, Magic Evasion -20%, AGI -80%</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Various support items</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">12x <strong>Red Bead\u00a0</strong>(Weapon upgrade material)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10x <strong>Blue Bead\u00a0</strong>(Weapon upgrade material)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">8x <strong>Gold Bead</strong> (Weapon upgrade material)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6x <strong>Purple Bead</strong> (Weapon upgrade material)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Note: Some items 